[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3180.15, "timestamp": "00:53:00", "text": "呃，多少钱？是60。加橄榄油"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3182.069, "timestamp": "00:53:02", "text": "洋葱可作沙拉酱。挑剔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3183.829, "timestamp": "00:53:03", "text": "顾客可以将食物留在盘子里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3186.39, "timestamp": "00:53:06", "text": "它必须足够强大。这难道不是太挑剔了吗？它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3188.349, "timestamp": "00:53:08", "text": "更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3192.15, "timestamp": "00:53:12", "text": "是的。我好累。我也是。夏普"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3195.95, "timestamp": "00:53:15", "text": "刀。我们需要那个吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3201.19, "timestamp": "00:53:21", "text": "不，我觉得我们没问题。正确的。作品。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3204.069, "timestamp": "00:53:24", "text": "不，我不这么认为。多少钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3214.63, "timestamp": "00:53:34", "text": "60美元。没关系。我们将把这一点保存下来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3215.91, "timestamp": "00:53:35", "text": "那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3218.39, "timestamp": "00:53:38", "text": "这个的极限在哪里？是什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3221.79, "timestamp": "00:53:41", "text": "这个柜子的极限是多少？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3225.51, "timestamp": "00:53:45", "text": "呃，当你已经有了洗碗机之后，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3227.829, "timestamp": "00:53:47", "text": "最好还是别管它。但你会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3230.39, "timestamp": "00:53:50", "text": "就像超级洗衣机或其他类似的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3233.58, "timestamp": "00:53:53", "text": "事情就是这样，它没有造成任何后果。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3236.51, "timestamp": "00:53:56", "text": "[音乐]"}]